# workflows.allow -- the workflows whose jobs the acer-web / dell-web job-started hook accepts.
# Installed ROOT-OWNED 0644 at /etc/ghrunner-web/workflows.allow (gate.conf key ALLOW_FILE).
# Format: one `.github/workflows/<name>.yml` (or .yaml) per line; blank lines and `#` comments
# are ignored. Any other line makes the hook refuse EVERY job (fail closed). A missing file means
# bom-check.yml only. A listed workflow still runs here only when its blob at the run's commit is
# byte-identical to main's, so listing a file trusts main's copy of it, never a PR's.
# Adding a line is a review item: waves 1-3 add one workflow per PR (docs/handover/ci-offload-wave0.md).
.github/workflows/bom-check.yml
